{"task_id": "HumanEval/1", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef separate_paren_groups(paren_string: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Separates a string into top-level balanced parenthesis groups, ignoring spaces.\n    Each returned group is a compacted string with no spaces.\n    \"\"\"\n    groups: List[str] = []\n    stack: List[str] = []\n    current_group_chars: List[str] = []\n\n    for char in paren_string:\n        if char == '(':\n            stack.append(char)\n            current_group_chars.append(char)\n        elif char == ')':\n            stack.pop() # Trust caller's input ensures stack is not empty here.\n            current_group_chars.append(char)\n            if not stack:\n                groups.append(''.join(current_group_chars))\n                current_group_chars = []\n        # Other characters, including spaces, are ignored.\n    return groups\n\n```"}
{"task_id": "HumanEval/1", "solution": "from typing import List\n\n\ndef separate_paren_groups(paren_string: str) -> List[str]:\n    \"\"\"Separates a string of balanced parenthesis groups into a list of distinct group strings.\n    Ignores any spaces in the input string, processing only parentheses.\n    \"\"\"\n    groups = []\n    depth = 0\n    current_group_chars = []\n\n    for char in paren_string:\n        if char == '(':\n            if depth == 0:\n                current_group_chars = []  # Start a new group if at top level\n            current_group_chars.append(char)\n            depth += 1\n        elif char == ')':\n            current_group_chars.append(char)\n            depth -= 1\n            if depth == 0:\n                groups.append(\"\".join(current_group_chars))\n                current_group_chars = []  # Reset for next top-level group\n        # Ignore other characters like whitespace as per problem statement and \"trust caller's input\" constraint.\n\n    return groups"}
