{"task_id": "HumanEval/13", "solution": "def greatest_common_divisor(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Return the greatest common divisor of two integers a and b.\n    Handles negative inputs and the special case gcd(0, 0) == 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Use absolute values for the Euclidean algorithm.\n    a_abs, b_abs = abs(a), abs(b)\n\n    # Business rule: gcd(0, 0) == 0.\n    if a_abs == 0 and b_abs == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # Apply the Euclidean algorithm.\n    while b_abs:\n        a_abs, b_abs = b_abs, a_abs % b_abs\n    return a_abs"}
