{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "```python\ndef fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number using the fast doubling method.\n    This method computes F(n) in O(log n) time.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _fast_doubling(k: int) -> tuple[int, int]:\n        if k == 0:\n            return (0, 1)\n        \n        a, b = _fast_doubling(k >> 1)\n        \n        c = a * (2 * b - a)\n        d = a * a + b * b\n        \n        if k & 1:\n            return (d, c + d)\n        else:\n            return (c, d)\n\n    return _fast_doubling(n)[0]\n```"}
