{"task_id": "HumanEval/99", "solution": "from decimal import Decimal\n\ndef closest_integer(value):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the closest integer to a numeric string.\n    Midpoint cases (x.5) are rounded away from zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    decimal_value = Decimal(value.strip())\n\n    lower_int = int(decimal_value.to_integral_value(rounding=\"ROUND_FLOOR\"))\n    upper_int = lower_int + 1\n\n    dist_lower = abs(decimal_value - Decimal(lower_int))\n    dist_upper = abs(Decimal(upper_int) - decimal_value)\n\n    if dist_lower < dist_upper:\n        return lower_int\n    elif dist_upper < dist_lower:\n        return upper_int\n    else:  # Equidistant, round away from zero\n        return upper_int if decimal_value >= 0 else lower_int"}
