{"task_id": "HumanEval/120", "solution": "```python\nimport heapq\n\ndef maximum(arr, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given an array arr of integers and an integer k, return a sorted list\n    of length k with the maximum k numbers in arr.\n    This function assumes valid inputs as per preconditions.\n    \"\"\"\n    if k == 0:\n        return []\n    if k == len(arr):\n        return sorted(arr)\n    \n    top_k_elements = heapq.nlargest(k, arr)\n    return sorted(top_k_elements)\n\n```"}
